  acceptedAnswers:
  - Horace Silver Quintet
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABJuicy Lucy - Rudy Van Gelder Edition /
    Remastered\xBB, de 1959, y llega hasta 1961."
  - "\xABDoin' The Thing - Live At Village Gate Club, New York, 1961 / Remastered
    2006 / Rudy Van Gelder Edition\xBB presenta una energ\xEDa media y un pulso cercano
    a 117 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABSwingin' The Samba - Rudy Van Gelder Edition
    / Remastered\xBB y \xABKiss Me Right - Live At Village Gate Club, New York, 1961
    / Remastered 2006 / Rudy Van Gelder Edition\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABFinger Poppin' - Rudy Van Gelder Edition / Remastered\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABFilthy McNasty - Live At Village Gate
    Club, New York, 1961 / Remastered 2006 / Rudy Van Gelder Edition\xBB y \xABCookin'
    At The Continental - Rudy Van Gelder Edition / Remastered\xBB."
